Error [E0152]: This regex pattern is invalid at position 0
  --> tests/ui/regex_bad_literal.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |     print(re.find({"(unclosed"}, "id=42") ?? "none")
    |                    ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: This `(` is never closed by a `)`
 Fix: Fix the pattern at that position; a `\` before ASCII punctuation matches it literally
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0152
